4G/5G/WiFi/BT Module
~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
|Product| does not include WiFi/BT and/or 4G/5G modules by default. These modules are optional and can be selected at the Chipsee store during the ordering process.

The 4G/5G module only supports USB2.0 speed.

